steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767160/extras/5071ca61077a075b3f3955b9f0b5fd1e.webp?t=1707235953\" width=221 height=46 /></span><br>This is not a pay-to-win game where there are limited contents blocked by purchase wall. In fact, a free player could obtain everything in the game. Gorgeous skins, extremely rare Ancient and Event Adorimons, ... all will be yours if you spend enough time and effort to get them. Doing daily quests regularly, joining in PvP Arena often, and you will have a top team in about 15 days. In PvP battles, it's experience and strategy brings you to victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767160/extras/07548459b1a86cbc4e82569fb9a144dd.poster.avif?t=1707235953\" width=544 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767160/extras/07548459b1a86cbc4e82569fb9a144dd.webm?t=1707235953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767160/extras/07548459b1a86cbc4e82569fb9a144dd.mp4?t=1707235953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
